  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88f6fa2b89436164b8e97b17d82dc9a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 16 - Combining Case Condition
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_match_cont
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Combining Case Condition
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'Multiple cases can be combined into a single condition inside a <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>match</color></font> statement. This is useful when different
    values should perform the same action.

    You can also add additional conditions
    using <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#D96DD3>if</color></font> inside a <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>case</color></font> statement.


    Example:

    <indent=1em><font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>match</color> tile:</font>

    <indent=3em><font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>case</color> <color=#CE9178>"WhiteOre"</color> | <color=#CE9178>"BlackOre"</color>:</font>

    <indent=5em><font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#33CC66>mine</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font></indent>

    <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>case</color> <color=#CE9178>"PurpleEssence"</color> <color=#D96DD3>if</color>
    <color=#33CC66>measure</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color> <color=#D4D4D4>></color>
    <color=#B5CEA8>5</color>:</font>

    <indent=5em><font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>collect</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font></indent>

    <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>case</color> _:</font>

    <indent=5em><font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#33CC66>move</color>(<color=#CE9178>"forward"</color>, <color=#B5CEA8>1</color>)</font></indent></indent></indent>

    In
    this example:

    <indent=2em>- Multiple values can share the same action using
    <font="JetBrainsMono SDF">|</font></indent>

    <indent=2em>- A <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>case</color></font> can include additional checks using <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#D96DD3>if</color></font></indent>

    <indent=2em>- <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF">_</font> acts as the default case when no other case matches</indent>'
  isImageBig: 0
